31	/**
32	 * <p>Data Matrix Codes can encode text as bits in one of several modes, and can use multiple modes
33	 * in one Data Matrix Code. This class decodes the bits back into text.</p>
34	 *
35	 * <p>See ISO 16022:2006, 5.2.1 - 5.2.9.2</p>
